# Release signing key + its passwords — NEVER commit these (added
# 2026-09-25). Keep a backup of both somewhere safe outside the repo:
# losing them means future updates can never be signed the same way
# again, and every installed phone would need a fresh uninstall/reinstall.
android/keystore.properties
android/*.jks
android/*.keystore
